{"ticker":"GWW","updated":"2026-10-23T23:03:27Z","profile":{"longName":"W.W. Grainger, Inc.","shortName":"W.W. Grainger, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Industrial Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.grainger.com","fullTimeEmployees":22100,"marketCap":63581564928,"trailingPE":34.427444,"forwardPE":26.436071,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3739223,"pegRatio":1.85,"targetMeanPrice":1331.5714,"targetHighPrice":1500.0,"targetLowPrice":1100.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.103,"earningsGrowth":0.205,"grossMargins":0.39395002,"operatingMargins":0.16072,"profitMargins":0.09923001,"totalRevenue":18844999680,"beta":1.013,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1419.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":906.52,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.73},"summary":"W.W. Grainger, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, distributes maintenance, repair, and operating products and services primarily in North America, Japan, and the United Kingdom. The company operates through two segments, High-Touch Solutions North America and Endless Assortment. It provides safety, security, material handling and storage equipment, pumps and plumbing equipment, cleaning and maintenance, and metalworking and hand tools. The company also offers technical support and inventory management services. It serves smaller businesses to large corporations, government entities, and other institutions, as well as commercial, healthcare, and manufacturing industries through sales and service representatives, and electronic and ecommerce channels. W.W. Grainger, Inc. was founded in 1927 and is headquartered in Lake Forest, Illinois.","summary_zh":"W.W. Grainger, Inc. 及其子公司主要在北美、日本和英國分銷維護、維修和營運產品及服務。該公司透過兩個部門營運：High-Touch Solutions North America 部門和 Endless Assortment 部門。它提供安全、安保、材料處理和儲存設備、泵浦和管道設備、清潔和維護以及金屬加工和手動工具。該公司還提供技術支援和庫存管理服務。它透過銷售和服務代表以及電子和電子商務管道為小型企業、大型企業、政府實體和其他機構以及商業、醫療保健和製造業提供服務。 W.W. Grainger, Inc. 成立於 1927 年，總部位於伊利諾州森林湖。","se